      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Focused on the new sushi chef, The Chef discovers a strange new person in the kitchen who doesn't speak Russian well. He asks Aynura about him. Let's listen closely to Ainura and Chef Viktor's exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
